msgid "Enable Akonadi plugin"
msgstr "Omogući dodatak Akonadi"

#. i18n: ectx: whatsthis, entry (UseAkonadiIfAvailable), group (General)
#: data/kalarmconfig.kcfg:79
#, kde-format
msgctxt "@info:whatsthis"
msgid ""
"Choose whether to enable KAlarm's Akonadi plugin, which uses Akonadi to "
"provide features including birthday import, some email functions, email "
"address book lookup, and Akonadi resource migration on first run."
msgstr "Odaberite želite li omogućiti dodatak Akonadi za KAlarm. Pruža uvoz rođendana, neke funkcije e-pošte, pretraživanje adresara i migraciju resursa Akonadija pri prvom pokretanju."

#. i18n: ectx: label, entry (Base_AudioBackend), group (General)
#: data/kalarmconfig.kcfg:83
#, kde-format
