"to store it in, if there is more than one active calendar.</para><para>Note "
"that archived alarms are always stored in the default archived alarm "
"calendar.</para>"
msgstr "<para>Pri spremanju novog alarma ili predloška pitaj u koji kalendar ga spremiti ako postoji više aktivnih kalendara.</para><para>Arhivirani se alarmi uvijek spremaju u zadani kalendar arhiviranih alarma.</para>"

